0-03T12:22:55Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:22:55Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"📝 docs: shell + adapter security review with remediation status\n\nPen-test style review of core, both adapters and the gateway scripts\n(H-1/H-2, M-1–M-4, L-1–L-4, I-1/I-2), plus a status table: H-1, M-1,\nM-2, L-2 fixed (core 0.6.0 / cloudscape), H-2 CSP in progress, M-3\nawaiting a decision on scoping shell.http.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"105b9384ffd66b1b9cff20a780c56cdfd8d7450d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/105b9384ffd66b1b9cff20a780c56cdfd8d7450d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/b575d63529c7d59ea74401639bb1a77ea0155e90","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/b575d63529c7d59ea74401639bb1a77ea0155e90","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGI1NzVkNjM1MjljN2Q1OWVhNzQ0MDE2MzliYjFhNzdlYTAxNTVlOTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1","sha":"f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1"}],"sha":"b575d63529c7d59ea74401639bb1a77ea0155e90","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/b575d63529c7d59ea74401639bb1a77ea0155e90"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:22:55Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:22:55Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"🔒 cloudscape: validate nav hrefs, honour external, clear password on submit\n\nSecurity review M-2 / L-2, ahead of the next trailhead-cloudscape release\n(no version bump yet; does not depend on core 0.6.0).\n\n- ShellLayout drops nav links whose href isn''t http(s) or, for internal\n  links, resolves off-origin — onFollow → location.href only ever sees\n  vetted hrefs. With the default appBasePath \"\" a javascript: href\n  previously reached location.href and executed. The guard is a local\n  copy of core''s isSafeHref because this adapter builds against the\n  published core; fold into a core export at the next joint release.\n- Honours NavLink.external like core does. Fixes the example sites''\n  Sign out link, which rendered as <appBasePath>/_auth/signout.\n- ShellApp clears the password from React state as soon as the\n  credential prompt is submitted, not on the next prompt.\n\nTests: ShellLayout characterisation tests added and passing first.\nCloudScape 13 → 25.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d124e8ce345d305b359c311fd0810205ad7e9821","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/d124e8ce345d305b359c311fd0810205ad7e9821"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGY2Njk3ZmY5ZGEyYjQwNzdiNDEzNjU5ZjgyN2E1MThmNjU0NGZjYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13","sha":"38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13"}],"sha":"f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/f6697ff9da2b4077b413659f827a518f6544fcb1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:22:48Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:22:48Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"🚀 core 0.6.0: shell.json deployment config + security hardening\n\nAdded: apiUrl and auth can be set per deployment in shell.json. Values\npassed to Trailhead.create() still win; shell.json supplies the default.\napiUrl and the auth endpoints from shell.json must be same-origin paths;\nan unknown strategy or unsafe endpoint is ignored with a warning and falls\nback to credentials. This lets deployments drop the inline\nwindow.APP_CONFIG script, a prerequisite for a script-src ''self'' CSP\n(security review H-2).\n\nSecurity (review H-1, M-1, M-2):\n- Navigation is built with DOM APIs instead of an innerHTML string, so\n  shell.json labels/icons/hrefs can''t inject markup.\n- Nav hrefs are resolved like the browser would; non-http(s) and\n  off-origin internal links are dropped. External links get\n  rel=\"noopener noreferrer\". navigate() refuses script/off-origin targets.\n- apps[] entries with an unsafe basePath or src are dropped, never loaded.\n\nChanged: create() now loads shell.json before wiring shell.http and\nexposing window.shell. Verified against both example sites in headless\nChromium: same behaviour and request counts; start-up timings within\n±3 ms of 0.5.3 (median of 15 cold loads per route).\n\nTests: characterisation tests for nav rendering and create() config\nhandling were added and passing before the code changed. Core 52 → 100.\npackages/types regenerated (two optional ShellManifest fields).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12a1213c4acf2eacc650bd5d3cd59b0a87a010c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/12a1213c4acf2eacc650bd5d3cd59b0a87a010c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDM4Y2I0Zjk2Y2I4ZGJkM2U5YzAyNGU2MDBkOWFjY2RhZmZhZThkMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6","sha":"56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6"}],"sha":"38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/38cb4f96cb8dbd3e9c024e600d9accdaffae8d13"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:22:41Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:22:41Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"🩹 preview-server: patch qs, body-parser and path-to-regexp\n\nnpm audit fix on the preview server lockfile. Resolves Dependabot alerts\n#1–#6 (path-to-regexp 8.3.0 → 8.4.2, qs 6.14.2 → 6.16.0, body-parser\n2.2.2 → 2.3.0); the earlier \"patched preview server\" commit left these on\nvulnerable versions. Lockfile only — express ^5.2.1 range unchanged.\nnpm audit: 0 vulnerabilities; server smoke-tested.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d8081a2bbd08ea5ec45b212f784e7664d30875a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/4d8081a2bbd08ea5ec45b212f784e7664d30875a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDU2MTY0NDcxYWRlODA1MDczN2ZjMTMxMjMxMmQ5NDRhMWE5ZjUwYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4","sha":"0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4"}],"sha":"56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/56164471ade8050737fc1312312d944a1a9f50b6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:21:10Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:21:10Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"docs: clarify URL rewriting is optional — per-app client-side routing (React Router) works\n\nStatic hosting stays zero-config for the flat baseline, but a single SPA can use\nits own router; nested deep links need the HOST to rewrite to the app''s index.html\n(optional, platform''s job) — as the aws-static-hosting JWT gateway does at the edge.","tree":{"sha":"50e140120635d30dbb366f6abcf1e63313ec0044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/50e140120635d30dbb366f6abcf1e63313ec0044"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDBjZjdmNmEyYjI5MTk3NTE5OTI0OWQ0ZWNkYTQ0MTNjMDQxODMwYjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef","sha":"6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef"}],"sha":"0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/0cf7f6a2b291975199249d4ecda4413c041830b4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:18:27Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:18:27Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"steering: update .kiro docs to current contract (AppMount, shell.json)\n\n- init(shell) -> window.AppMount(root, basePath) in code samples + flow + build steps\n- navigation.json -> shell.json, and the old flat-array manifest -> current {apps,nav} shape\nKeeps future agent context aligned with the shipped API.","tree":{"sha":"ff9fc5efd5154e45745b57018716e094fac00b7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/ff9fc5efd5154e45745b57018716e094fac00b7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDZjNzhkYmZjZGI3NTcyNTQ3NDJjNmJiYjIxZjNiODZmNDNkMDUzZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234","sha":"2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234"}],"sha":"6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/6c78dbfcdb757254742c6bbb21f3b86f43d053ef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:15:00Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:15:00Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"docs: use Trailhead.create() not the removed new Trailhead(); fix stale AppMount JSDoc\n\n- README + CHANGELOG 0.5.2 auth examples: new Trailhead(...) -> Trailhead.create(...)\n- shell-api.ts ShellAPI @example: init(shell) -> AppMount(root, basePath) (regenerates types)\nNote: shell-api.ts is a published source change — needs a core republish to reach consumers'' editors.","tree":{"sha":"d49c3e78947b12a6ddf5e226271b5e79073546af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/d49c3e78947b12a6ddf5e226271b5e79073546af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDJkYWQ5NTEyMDg5ZGNkZTQ3MzM2M2ExNmE3MTcxNTU5YmZjMzIyMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a","sha":"06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a"}],"sha":"2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/2dad9512089dcde473363a16a7171559bfc32234"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:12:57Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:12:57Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"docs: rewrite docs/ for the current AppMount API; add Shell API + Deployment pages\n\n- Standardize the SPA contract on window.AppMount(root, basePath); remove every\n  stale init(shell) usage and new Trailhead(...) startup across docs/ + PROBLEM_STATEMENT.md.\n- ARCHITECTURE: rewrite for Trailhead.create()+ShellApp.mount startup, correct the\n  AppMount data-flow, add both session-recovery flows (credentials + cognito),\n  document relative-only apiUrl and the two explicit auth strategies, drop the ✅-bullet tic.\n- GETTING_STARTED: fix the dev loop to the real two-server + Vite-proxy flow (no copy step),\n  complete the mock shell, cover session expiry under both strategies.\n- CREATING_ADAPTERS: clarify the adapter prompt backs the credentials strategy only\n  (cognito needs no adapter auth UI); drop ✅ tics; add cross-links.\n- PROBLEM_STATEMENT: correct init(shell) -> AppMount in prose and sample (essay voice kept).\n- Add docs/SHELL_API.md (window.shell reference), docs/DEPLOYMENT.md (static hosting +\n  the aws-static-hosting Cognito gateway), docs/README.md (index); cross-link all docs\n  and add the new pages to the root README Further Reading.","tree":{"sha":"c64e8d6f0b87c35f0098a1450e6e4e66a1e8ebec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/c64e8d6f0b87c35f0098a1450e6e4e66a1e8ebec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDA2YjM3MDZkNzI4NTc1ZjFkZmVjNWQxMzI5ZTllMmYwZTQ1MWM2OGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8","sha":"2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8"}],"sha":"06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/06b3706d728575f1dfec5d1329e9e2f0e451c68a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:00:41Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:00:41Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"docs: README covers cognito auth strategy + relative-only apiUrl\n\n- apiUrl: note it applies to relative shell.http paths only (absolute URLs as-is)\n- Re-authentication: document both strategies — credentials (in-place prompt) and\n  cognito (shell.http 401 auto-recovery, recoverSession, overridable endpoints)\n- credential example uses shell.http + Result instead of a bare fetch\n- Developing Locally: real shell(3001)+SPA(3000) proxy dev loop, not copy-to-public\n- appBasePath /app gateway guidance","tree":{"sha":"6416f8c6338cfef4f863072cec6832ccc54cd535","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/6416f8c6338cfef4f863072cec6832ccc54cd535"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDIyNzRlZDljMzBhYjM3N2MyZmE4OGQwMzQwZDZkY2Y3NzZmMjA5ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43","sha":"67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43"}],"sha":"2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/2274ed9c30ab377c2fa88d0340d6dcf776f209d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:57:12Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:57:12Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"🩹🚀 patch dependencies and release new versions of all trailhead packages.","tree":{"sha":"83e707bd2fcc7b531f0f5c098977e3cc79c29bb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/83e707bd2fcc7b531f0f5c098977e3cc79c29bb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDY3ZWI1YWU0ZGQ2ODE3NTU2YzUyMjI0ZGEzNjE1ZjU2NzUwM2VmNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f","sha":"cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f"}],"sha":"67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/67eb5ae4dd6817556c52224da3615f567503ef43"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:48:08Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:48:08Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"examples: bump shell @herdingbits deps to core 0.5.3 / webawesome 0.5.2 / cloudscape 0.5.3\n\nReinstall + ncu -u across the 6 example packages against the newly\npublished core 0.5.3 (relative-only apiUrl fix), types 0.4.3, webawesome\n0.5.2, cloudscape 0.5.3. Only the two shells carry @herdingbits runtime\nranges, so only their manifests/locks change; the four apps resolved\nidentically. Verified in preview: with apiUrl=/api, the webawesome demo''s\nGET Success now hits https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/users/1 directly\n(200), no /api/https mangling.","tree":{"sha":"4bc8db253c201ce1b4e219f69de267c9d54ae3ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/4bc8db253c201ce1b4e219f69de267c9d54ae3ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGNiNzEyZmRiYTJjYjRjYThjZjQ0NTdhYjk0NTU0MjBlOWZkMmRiNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30","sha":"d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30"}],"sha":"cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/cb712fdba2cb4ca8cf4457ab9455420e9fd2db6f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:30:40Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:30:40Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"🚀 core 0.5.3: shell.http relative-only apiUrl fix; document 0.5.2 cognito auth\n\nBump trailhead-core 0.5.2 -> 0.5.3 (0.5.2 is already published, so publishing\nneeds a new version). CHANGELOG: add the 0.5.3 entry (relative-only apiUrl fix)\nand the missing 0.5.2 entry (the cognito session-recovery strategy, auth config,\nrecoverSession, and shell.http 401 auto-recovery, shipped in 0.5.2 undocumented).","tree":{"sha":"d3d05693228fe1b18008ee523a24a8fd34588167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/d3d05693228fe1b18008ee523a24a8fd34588167"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGQ4MmJiYjhhZWZlMWM5YjZiYzEyOTQ4NmU3MWJlYTExOWQ4MGNjMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c","sha":"baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c"}],"sha":"d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/d82bbb8aefe1c9b6bc129486e71bea119d80cc30"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:25:13Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:25:13Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"core: shell.http prepends apiUrl to relative paths only, not absolute URLs\n\nky''s prefix concatenated unconditionally, so under apiUrl=\"/api\" a call like\nshell.http.get(\"https://host/x\") became \"/api/https://host/x\". Resolve the URL\nourselves: absolute (http(s)://) and protocol-relative (//host) URLs bypass the\nbase; only relative paths get apiUrl prepended. +4 tests.","tree":{"sha":"c79f2b34e66701f60d6b58415e097f78bbe8b0ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/c79f2b34e66701f60d6b58415e097f78bbe8b0ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGJhYWQwODFiOGJiYmU5M2M0ZDY0YWU5NDIzNGIwYjgxN2I2ZmQ0MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf","sha":"7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf"}],"sha":"baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/baad081b8bbbe93c4d64ae94234b0b817b6fd40c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:18:07Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:18:07Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"examples: write per-app index.html so gateway deep links resolve\n\nThe gateway gate rewrites an extensionless deep link <APP_BASE_PATH>/<app> to the\nS3 key <APP_BASE_PATH>/<app>/index.html (resolveAppShell). S3-behind-OAC has no\ndirectory index, so a missing object returns 403 Access Denied — which is what\n/app/demo hit. Copy the configured shell index.html into each app folder (per\nTrailhead''s every-route-has-its-own-index.html model), and inject APP_CONFIG\nbefore that copy so every route carries apiUrl + authMode.","tree":{"sha":"ef62cdf28f51e0a46dc4c86de9fee98a0fddf25d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/ef62cdf28f51e0a46dc4c86de9fee98a0fddf25d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDdhZDcxNjBlMDg0YTk2NjEzMjk2MDM4ZTQ0YmYwMmIzNDkwYTBjZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e","sha":"41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e"}],"sha":"7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/7ad7160e084a96613296038e44bf02b3490a0cdf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:05:45Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T10:05:45Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"examples: add gateway build + deploy scripts\n\nbuild-for-gateway.sh builds both example sites (shell with VITE_APP_BASE_PATH,\neach app placed at its shell.json basePath, APP_CONFIG injected with apiUrl +\nauthMode) into the git-ignored examples/.deploy/<site>/.\ndeploy-to-gateway.sh syncs one staged site to a jwt-auth-gateway S3 bucket under\nAPP_BASE_PATH with --delete --cache-control no-cache, a dry-run + confirm, and an\noptional CloudFront invalidation.","tree":{"sha":"4f02ad9d0f0ef5ba604c3f44a18453c47b68d7da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/4f02ad9d0f0ef5ba604c3f44a18453c47b68d7da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDQxMDczMDgxMjk1NTc2YjI3ZjU0OWY4MmM2OTg5NWRlMzZkNDQxN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/ecaf07191a0d2cb54e521126858d7bafe84dc281","sha":"ecaf07191a0d2cb54e521126858d7bafe84dc281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ecaf07191a0d2cb54e521126858d7bafe84dc281"}],"sha":"41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/41073081295576b27f549f82c69895de36d4417e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ecaf07191a0d2cb54e521126858d7bafe84dc281/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T09:53:15Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T09:53:15Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"examples: clean reinstall + ncu upgrade all deps; pin herdingbits ranges to published 0.5.2/0.4.3/0.5.1\n\nFresh node_modules + package-lock across all 6 example packages (ncu -u).\n@herdingbits/* ranges tightened to the published versions carrying the new\ncognito session-recovery API. UI-verified in preview mode: both shells render,\nSign out nav link present, and both Simulate Session Expiry (credential) and\nRecover Session (Cognito) buttons work.","tree":{"sha":"9264171ab11c468d9955fc2adb4eff76b455e10f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/9264171ab11c468d9955fc2adb4eff76b455e10f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/ecaf07191a0d2cb54e521126858d7bafe84dc281","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/ecaf07191a0d2cb54e521126858d7bafe84dc281","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGVjYWYwNzE5MWEwZDJjYjU0ZTUyMTEyNjg1OGQ3YmFmZTg0ZGMyODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailh