13T08:08:33Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Bump trailhead-webawesome''s dependencies to latest and republish as 0.4.0\n\n@awesome.me/webawesome 3.10->3.12, jsdom 29->30, typescript 6->7, vitest 4->5, plus the trailhead-core peer range and trailhead-types dev range bumped to ^0.4.0 to match the newly-published core/types. Clean install, build, and full test suite (28 tests) verified before publish.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"644655b017b1810ab5218294357fb6022def8f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/644655b017b1810ab5218294357fb6022def8f11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/004c97b4bacb1a6a7d2737ba6704d0f7d83740fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/004c97b4bacb1a6a7d2737ba6704d0f7d83740fd","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDAwNGM5N2I0YmFjYjFhNmE3ZDI3MzdiYTY3MDRkMGY3ZDgzNzQwZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785","sha":"fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785"}],"sha":"004c97b4bacb1a6a7d2737ba6704d0f7d83740fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/004c97b4bacb1a6a7d2737ba6704d0f7d83740fd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:07:32Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:07:32Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Bump trailhead-core''s dependencies to latest and republish as 0.4.0\n\nky 2.0->2.1, jsdom 29->30, typescript 6->7, vitest 4->5 — clean install, build, and full test suite (19 tests) all verified against the new majors before this was published.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b5de1b0c614f68510edba0dbfa8fadfc39c7807a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/b5de1b0c614f68510edba0dbfa8fadfc39c7807a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGZkMmI3MzY2ZGZhZDRhZDY3MjJkYmE1ODg3MDNjZmJiODE3Zjc3ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb","sha":"28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb"}],"sha":"fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/fd2b7366dfad4ad6722dba588703cfbb817f7785"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:07:09Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:07:09Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Bump trailhead-types to 0.4.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1515a114535a44bdb9ff4927447c25778c5c79d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/1515a114535a44bdb9ff4927447c25778c5c79d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDI4YWU4NWYzMjAyYzAwZDFlZGRhNGRjNTI0MTM4MjBhZGRmOGFmY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00","sha":"798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00"}],"sha":"28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/28ae85f3202c00d1edda4dc52413820addf8afcb"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:06:49Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:06:49Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Dedupe examples/*/tsconfig.json via a shared base config\n\nAll 6 example projects (both sites'' shell + apps/demo + apps/saas-demo) repeated the same ~15 compiler options verbatim. Extracted the common ones into examples/tsconfig.base.json; each project''s own config now only states jsx (React apps only) and noUnusedLocals (false for the two shells) plus its own include path. Same base-config path-resolution caveat as the packages/* dedup applies here too. Verified clean typechecks across all 6 (pre-existing, unrelated tsc errors in cloudscape-site''s apps are unchanged from before this change).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6240dfaa8c24577b2a0160a4ccd06d4825556a7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/6240dfaa8c24577b2a0160a4ccd06d4825556a7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDc5OGQzOTdjODIwYzY2OWNlMjUxNjhlMmJlYjNjZDczMjYyYmJjMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5","sha":"4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5"}],"sha":"798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/798d397c820c669ce25168e2beb3cd73262bbc00"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:06:02Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:06:02Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Dedupe packages/*/tsconfig.json via a shared base config\n\ncore, webawesome, and cloudscape each repeated the same ~10 compiler options verbatim. Extracted the common, path-independent ones (target, module, lib, moduleResolution, declaration, strict, etc.) into packages/tsconfig.base.json; each project''s own tsconfig.json now only states its real differences (jsx for cloudscape, an extra exclude entry for webawesome) plus the path-relative options (outDir/rootDir/include/exclude) that have to stay per-project since TypeScript resolves a base config''s relative paths against the base file''s own location, not the extending project''s. Verified byte-identical build output across all three.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7269d8d2558b1aa2d55b09d835a928bbe194b426","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/7269d8d2558b1aa2d55b09d835a928bbe194b426"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDQ4NjZkM2MyNzk1OWJmYTExMGUyYzc5OTYzYjk0Y2M4ZTZlOGYxYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576","sha":"08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576"}],"sha":"4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/4866d3c27959bfa110e2c79963b94cc8e6e8f1c5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:05:18Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:05:18Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Escape caller-supplied text before it reaches innerHTML\n\nshowToast''s message, showDialog''s message/button label/button value, and the auth prompt''s error message were all interpolated into innerHTML template literals unescaped — confirmed exploitable via live pentest with an <img onerror> payload in each. DialogConfig.message is documented as plain body text, not HTML, and the CloudScape adapter already renders the same interface safely via JSX''s default escaping; this brings webawesome to the same guarantee.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60728adf3f02b17951fc23c34b564f8fcfaf2f0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/60728adf3f02b17951fc23c34b564f8fcfaf2f0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDA4YWFlZWM0OWE2Nzk0OWQyN2U0NDQzYzVkMDI1MzEwMTM2YjY1NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19","sha":"ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19"}],"sha":"08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/08aaeec49a67949d27e4443c5d025310136b6576"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:04:01Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T08:04:01Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Harden the reauth BroadcastChannel against accidental cross-feature collisions\n\nSuccess is now a structured {channel, type} message instead of a bare \"success\" string, so an unrelated same-origin feature that happens to reuse this channel name (or broadcast that exact string for its own reasons) can''t accidentally satisfy someone else''s pending prompt. This is not, and can''t be, real sender authentication — BroadcastChannel has none, and this source is public — so a targeted attacker with same-origin script execution can still reproduce the shape. Documented that trust assumption explicitly in the code rather than overclaiming a fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6d10b1a703c29da809ea337da7cc0fd57bac857","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/c6d10b1a703c29da809ea337da7cc0fd57bac857"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGJhNTM0YTZhZGM5YTlmZmNjM2JkMGYwYzQ0YWNkZDYyZTQ2OWZjMTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6","sha":"901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6"}],"sha":"ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ba534a6adc9a9ffcc3bd0f0c44acdd62e469fc19"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:59:26Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:59:26Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Bump create-trailhead to 0.0.11\n\ntemplates/ is gitignored and regenerated from examples/ at publish time (see build.js), so this diff can''t show it — but the templates were stale on npm (pinned to trailhead ^0.1.x, predating auth entirely, with the same #app/#root mount bug fixed in cloudscape-site). This version ships the regenerated, fixed templates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e92cb5894d334fa60096d3de518c9c9d8e37ccf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/e92cb5894d334fa60096d3de518c9c9d8e37ccf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDkwMTE2N2JiZDA0MTJjYWNjYWEwNDI2NDk1OWVjZjUyN2Q0YzUxZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946","sha":"4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946"}],"sha":"901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/901167bbd0412caccaa04264959ecf527d4c51f6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:59:00Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:59:00Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Bump trailhead-core to 0.3.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9437f80adf5262bf838afa8171f419d4c03daf67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/9437f80adf5262bf838afa8171f419d4c03daf67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDRiNTgxYWRjMjVkNjBiZWU0MjFkOWRmNGZiYjJiMjg3YWE4N2Q5NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d","sha":"f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d"}],"sha":"4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/4b581adc25d60bee421d9df4fbb2b287aa87d946"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:58:38Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:58:38Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Update cloudscape-site to trailhead 0.3.0, demo re-authentication, fix standalone mount point\n\nSame update as webawesome-site: bumps off stale ^0.1.x, adds an Authentication section + auth mock stub. Also fixes a real bug found along the way — demo/saas-demo''s index.html mounted to <div id=\"app\">, but each app''s own standalone-dev fallback in index.tsx looked for #root, so neither ever actually rendered outside the real shell. Added the missing #root div; #app stays for when the shell dev server is also running.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be233709f35e42892012349e0297a51b5e0b1fbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/be233709f35e42892012349e0297a51b5e0b1fbe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGY2NzgxM2JhOTUxOGQxZjk3ZmVlZmQyYWUwODFjYjU0ZTBmOTBlM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b","sha":"bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b"}],"sha":"f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/f67813ba9518d1f97feefd2ae081cb54e0f90e3d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:58:09Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:58:09Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Update webawesome-site to trailhead 0.3.0 and demo re-authentication\n\nBumps shell/demo/saas-demo off stale ^0.1.x ranges (predating auth entirely) to the real published 0.3.0. Adds an Authentication section to the demo app showing window.shell.auth.reauthenticate() end to end (demo/demo123 succeeds, anything else shows the retry-with-error flow), and the matching auth stub to both apps'' standalone mock shells so they don''t crash when run outside the real shell.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"039d22f295286340fca4e9e18ff953067fff3fdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/039d22f295286340fca4e9e18ff953067fff3fdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGJmZWRiMzZkN2NiYzM0YjQyN2ExNzliNWJhOGI2YjNkMjA4YWI4MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032","sha":"51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032"}],"sha":"bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/bfedb36d7cbc34b427a179b5ba8b6b3d208ab82b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:57:30Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:57:30Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Document re-authentication across the README and guides\n\nThe feature had zero documentation — including a stale getting-started mock shell that was missing the now-required auth field, which anyone following the tutorial literally would have hit as a runtime error. Adds a README overview with a working example, an architecture writeup (component, data-flow diagram, and the required-adapter-with-a-noop-default design decision), a full \"Implementing Authentication Prompts\" guide for adapter authors with the gotchas that aren''t obvious from the interface alone, and a getting-started step with a troubleshooting entry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"701f0016f313600a3f88eeab0dec06e2a46bfcdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/701f0016f313600a3f88eeab0dec06e2a46bfcdf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDUxMjgzYjBlMTI2YTFjM2JkYzgzNTY3NTg5YjI4NDIyZjA4NmMwMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c","sha":"77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c"}],"sha":"51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/51283b0e126a1c3bdc83567589b28422f086c032"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:56:51Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:56:51Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Add test coverage for the feedback and auth event-bridge contracts\n\nCovers flash-message/busy-state notifications, the cloudscape-dialog and cloudscape-auth event dispatch (including close() firing cloudscape-auth-dismiss), and double-resolve safety on the auth prompt — the DOM-manipulation counterpart to webawesome''s adapter tests, exercised through vitest+jsdom without needing to render the React ShellApp component. This package had no tests before now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e6c86fb13f8bfb9a8517084aa3573aa8772cb92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/5e6c86fb13f8bfb9a8517084aa3573aa8772cb92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDc3ZDJmYjE5YjkxOGY5ZTJiYjJiM2YwOTA1OGUxNmNkMjVkNWZkMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613","sha":"c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613"}],"sha":"77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/77d2fb19b918f9e2bb2b3f09058e16cd25d5fd1c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:56:17Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:56:17Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Add a real Modal-based re-authentication prompt\n\nReplaces the NoopAuthAdapter placeholder with a working CloudScapeAuthAdapter, using the same window-event bridge as showDialog() so the actual UI lives in ShellApp as a real CloudScape <Modal> with FormField/Input/Alert — not a bolted-on dialog. A fresh promptCredentials() call on retry (after a wrong password) just updates that same modal''s state rather than closing and reopening it, and close() lets another tab''s successful login dismiss this one''s prompt without resolving it as a cancel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7084c84cdb7ee2d294199a75bbe347dbec8a9a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/f7084c84cdb7ee2d294199a75bbe347dbec8a9a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGM0MTU0ZDAzZGMxN2M4NTRkZDU1NzRmMzczOWUzNjg0OGUwYjY2MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1","sha":"6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1"}],"sha":"c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/c4154d03dc17c854dd5574f3739e36848e0b6613"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:55:23Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:55:23Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Rebuild the feedback and auth UI on real Web Awesome widgets, with tests\n\nshowDialog/showBusy/showToast were hand-rolled <div>s styled to look like the design system rather than actual wa-dialog/wa-button/wa-spinner/wa-callout components — despite this being the Web Awesome adapter. Rebuilt all three on real widgets, and added the new re-authentication prompt (a wa-dialog with wa-input fields) the same way from the start. Toast/callout icons default to Web Awesome''s \"solid\" style rather than \"regular\" — the latter is Font Awesome Pro-only and 403s silently on a free kit.\n\nAdds full test coverage (dialog button-variant mapping, toast icon/variant mapping, the busy dialog''s Escape-key lockout while active, and the auth prompt''s submit/cancel/dismiss/close paths) plus the vitest+jsdom tooling to run it — this package had no tests before now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cf630151c59d1d23bb75761b72bf153a459f492","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/0cf630151c59d1d23bb75761b72bf153a459f492"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDZlNTBhMjg0NjU3OTVlZjdkNmM1ZGQ3YmI3ZmNkMDI2MmE4ZjI4YjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f","sha":"a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f"}],"sha":"6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/6e50a28465795ef7d6c5dd7bb7fcd0262a8f28b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:54:13Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:54:13Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Regenerate published types to include the new auth interfaces, bump to 0.3.0\n\nThese .d.ts files are generated from packages/core''s build and published as their own package so SPAs can install types without pulling in the runtime. Mirrors AuthAdapter, Credentials, CredentialPromptHandle, NoopAuthAdapter, and ShellAPI.auth from the previous core commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5ac317205a72d212d3f1addf1e888853eb45f5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/f5ac317205a72d212d3f1addf1e888853eb45f5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGE3ODE3NTU3OTA5M2FiZjk4ZjZlYzZjMTIxZGVkOTZiOGNjOTVjOGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974","sha":"e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974"}],"sha":"a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/a78175579093abf98f6ec6c121ded96b8cc95c8f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:53:31Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:53:31Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Add test coverage for the shell API''s dialog-building and reauth delegation\n\nconfirm/ok/yesNo/yesNoCancel/custom build DialogConfig objects and interpret the adapter''s result — logic that predates the auth feature and had zero coverage. Exercises it through the real Trailhead class against a fake adapter, alongside auth.reauthenticate''s delegation to the reauthenticator and the NoopAuthAdapter decline-everything default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27c5f70a5e547c7921096c249a3a6e075b63d264","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/27c5f70a5e547c7921096c249a3a6e075b63d264"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGU1YWViNjU4ZTIyYzJjOTdkNThlZWZmODU2MDlhMmY1ZDQ4MjE5NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78","sha":"127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78"}],"sha":"e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/e5aeb658e22c2c97d58eeff85609a2f5d4821974"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:52:30Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:52:30Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Remove dead legacy feedback module\n\nsrc/lib/feedback.ts was the original hard-coded busy/toast/dialog implementation from before the adapter pattern existed. It has zero imports anywhere in the codebase and isn''t exported from the package''s public API — fully superseded by each design system''s own FeedbackAdapter implementation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f16b9a19220397a4d37a928c581df0403998a46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/9f16b9a19220397a4d37a928c581df0403998a46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKDEyN2QzYTVkMmFiYzljMTEwY2VkNjQ4YmQwNDY0YTk1MDFhZjFkNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e","sha":"ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e"}],"sha":"127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/127d3a5d2abc9c110ced648bd0464a9501af1d78"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:51:54Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T04:51:54Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"Add re-authentication support to the shell API\n\nLets an app recover from an expired session in place — show a credential prompt, retry the failed action — instead of losing whatever the user was doing to a silent failure or a full-page login. AuthAdapter is a required field on every DesignSystemAdapter so no adapter can silently skip it, but NoopAuthAdapter lets one opt out with zero UI work until a real prompt is built. createReauthenticator dedupes concurrent calls to one in-flight prompt and uses a BroadcastChannel so a second tab logging back in first dismisses every other tab''s prompt automatically.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8df6cd944d12eb70703ee5404683c07607c29caf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/8df6cd944d12eb70703ee5404683c07607c29caf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e","node_id":"C_kwDOQ8teBNoAKGZmOTExOTQ0MjhiNGRhMjdkODdmNGQ5NzQwMzI5MTFiZjE3MjBhOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhead/commit/cce6ad56afa5b1fe7799090ae89a4eae308ad28b","sha":"cce6ad56afa5b1fe7799090ae89a4eae308ad28b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/cce6ad56afa5b1fe7799090ae89a4eae308ad28b"}],"sha":"ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/ff91194428b4da27d87f4d974032911bf1720a8e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/commits/cce6ad56afa5b1fe7799090ae89a4eae308ad28b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T01:06:39Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T01:06:39Z","email":"mscherzer@gmail.com","name":"marcel"},"message":"🩹 patch all packages.","tree":{"sha":"535e4c7bb5aa1e844df2d9d208b1c89287ac0b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/trees/535e4c7bb5aa1e844df2d9d208b1c89287ac0b77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quicken/trailhead/git/commits/cce6ad56afa5b1fe7799090ae89a4eae308ad28b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/quicken/trailhea