div.stats → moved outside\n- Redesign trackby-list as self-contained comparison widget\n- Redesign heat-map: grid layout, color scale (blue→amber→red), pulse animation\n- Extract auto-renders stats outside cards into dedicated stats rows\n- Unify language to English across component\n\nPlayground layout:\n- Remove redundant content-header banner (duplicated lab titles)\n- Remove dead buttons: Switch Implementation, Reset Demo (console.log only)\n- Remove dashboard placeholder (router already redirects to concepts/overview)\n- Simplify PlaygroundLayoutComponent to mobile-menu logic only (~30 lines)\n\nOverview:\n- Fix memory leak: clearInterval in ngOnDestroy\n- Remove dead code: unused LabCard/ConceptCard interfaces and arrays, commented section\n- Mark unimplemented labs as Coming Soon (non-clickable, reduced opacity)\n- Promote Signals vs Observables to active lab\n\nResponsive:\n- Fix performance-lab container padding (safe-area-inset misuse as top padding)\n- Add mobile breakpoints for comparison-stats-row and trackby-stats-row\n- Fix styles.css: minmax(300px/350px/240px) → minmax(min(Xpx, 100%), 1fr)\n- Signals lab: tab nav compact on mobile, hide emoji icons at 768px,\n  smaller counter controls at 480px\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4b8f18b2aa9932b4d8c04d40d21178dd5a9d069","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frakxman/frontend-architecture-playground/git/trees/b4b8f18b2aa9932b4d8c04d40d21178dd5a9d069"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frakxman/frontend-architecture-playground/git/commits/52c1482b782f3c787e277c5b9f53b09fd5eaf5d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41605810?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frakxman/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frakxman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frakxman/following{