:{"date":"2026-09-22T16:13:18Z","email":"hensojr@gmail.com","name":"Ryan"},"message":"Remove trivyignores reference from workflow\n\nThe .trivyignore file was deleted in b07091e since its only entry\n(sharp/next version mismatch) is now resolved. The trivy-action was\nstill pointed at the now-missing file, causing\n\"ERROR: cannot find ignorefile ''.trivyignore''\" to fail the build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56fd56ad205c1ff29c932cb907e9c7f2b2a23f82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/git/trees/56fd56ad205c1ff29c932cb907e9c7f2b2a23f82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/git/commits/557101be45afdcba321586fef9d8fcba5bb51c66","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21116547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson","id":21116547,"login":"JRyanHenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTE2NTQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commit/557101be45afdcba321586fef9d8fcba5bb51c66","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9JVttoAKDU1NzEwMWJlNDVhZmRjYmEzMjE1ODZmZWY5ZDhmY2JhNWJiNTFjNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commit/b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5","sha":"b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commits/b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5"}],"sha":"557101be45afdcba321586fef9d8fcba5bb51c66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commits/557101be45afdcba321586fef9d8fcba5bb51c66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21116547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson","id":21116547,"login":"JRyanHenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTE2NTQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commits/b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T16:11:00Z","email":"hensojr@gmail.com","name":"Ryan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T16:11:00Z","email":"hensojr@gmail.com","name":"Ryan"},"message":"Fix Trivy CI failure: bump next to 16.3.5, strip npm from runtime image\n\nnext@16.2.11 was flagged for CVE-2026-75604/GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4 (critical\nRCE). Bumping to 16.3.5 fixes it and pulls in sharp@0.35.4, which also\nresolves the HIGH sharp CVE and makes the .trivyignore entry obsolete.\n\nAlso strip npm/npx/corepack from the runner stage — the container only\nruns `node server.js` and never needs them, but their bundled transitive\ndeps (tar, pacote, brace-expansion) were newly flagged as HIGH/CRITICAL\nand would have failed the scan again on the next CI run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87f621c67f6e57bce3c1580c0a8d2823523675a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/git/trees/87f621c67f6e57bce3c1580c0a8d2823523675a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/git/commits/b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21116547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson","id":21116547,"login":"JRyanHenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTE2NTQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commit/b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9JVttoAKGIwNzA5MWUwOWEwNzk2Yzg2MWJlNjA4NDdiMzU4NDAzZjA4YzA0YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commit/bc6716a658d402b22ca6f20069339c286132efb2","sha":"bc6716a658d402b22ca6f20069339c286132efb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commits/bc6716a658d402b22ca6f20069339c286132efb2"}],"sha":"b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commits/b07091e09a0796c861be60847b358403f08c04b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21116547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson","id":21116547,"login":"JRyanHenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTE2NTQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commits/bc6716a658d402b22ca6f20069339c286132efb2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:16:25Z","email":"hensojr@gmail.com","name":"Ryan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T15:16:25Z","email":"hensojr@gmail.com","name":"Ryan"},"message":"Upgrade next to 16.2.11, pin aws credentials action, add trivyignore\n\nBumps next 16.2.6 → 16.2.11 to resolve CVE-2026-64641/64642/64645/64649\n(DoS and SSRF in App Router/Server Actions). Adds .trivyignore for\nGHSA-f88m-g3jw-g9cj (sharp/libvips) which is unfixable until Next.js\nships support for sharp 0.35.0 in a stable release. Bumps\nconfigure-aws-credentials v4 → v6 to resolve Node.js 20 deprecation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b3d9d18650fd2887c1dfbd6d9f5d0f78d963766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/git/trees/0b3d9d18650fd2887c1dfbd6d9f5d0f78d963766"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/git/commits/bc6716a658d402b22ca6f20069339c286132efb2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21116547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson","id":21116547,"login":"JRyanHenson","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMTE2NTQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JRyanHenson","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commit/bc6716a658d402b22ca6f20069339c286132efb2","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9JVttoAKGJjNjcxNmE2NThkNDAyYjIyY2E2ZjIwMDY5MzM5YzI4NjEzMmVmYjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commit/19eb0927074b967f1da09647bb0691d0e41474aa","sha":"19eb0927074b967f1da09647bb0691d0e41474aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JRyanHenson/whoami-site/commits/19eb0927074b967f1da09647bb0691d0e41