":"2026-04-14T16:46:53Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"feat: single-step new patient creation via demographics MFE\n\n- Remove shell-side new patient modal; + New Patient now navigates to /dashboard/demographics/new\n- Demographics MFE detects patientId===''new'', opens Edit modal with empty state\n- On save: POST /api/patients then PUT demographics, then fires navigate-to-patient event\n- On cancel: fires navigate-to-patient with null, shell restores previous URL\n- Shell dashboard saves returnUrl on new-patient-requested event for clean cancel navigation\n- Dashboard guards against patientId ''new'' triggering API fetch\n- Add updateTopLevelName() to IPatientRepository interface and both Mongo/Knex adapters\n- Fix IPatientRepository missing module.exports (caused 500 on all patient-service routes)","tree":{"sha":"a241bc8f56c1dcb9a1b6a89e77b52f851a6cb786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/a241bc8f56c1dcb9a1b6a89e77b52f851a6cb786"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/f41dbb64ee139abd95aa44a085066401b4bce76e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/f41dbb64ee139abd95aa44a085066401b4bce76e","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKGY0MWRiYjY0ZWUxMzlhYmQ5NWFhNDRhMDg1MDY2NDAxYjRiY2U3NmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/2824c1ed5a825b5bd5688e97b745e381231c1d40","sha":"2824c1ed5a825b5bd5688e97b745e381231c1d40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/2824c1ed5a825b5bd5688e97b745e381231c1d40"}],"sha":"f41dbb64ee139abd95aa44a085066401b4bce76e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/f41dbb64ee139abd95aa44a085066401b4bce76e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/28