s/48edd37e99d26540702baaa3102f2c8a901ef594/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T16:12:31Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T16:12:31Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"feat(ai): streaming LLM summary + fix age/gender/timeout/vitals/reset\n\n- ai-orchestrator: new POST /recommend-stream SSE endpoint covering the\n  full pipeline (phase events during agent analysis, rec created event,\n  then LLM tokens) so the UI shows live progress from click to done\n- ai-orchestrator: POST /recommendations/:id/stream-summary kept for\n  standalone re-streaming; approvalStore: getById + updateSummary added\n- ai-orchestrator: POST /recommend no longer waits for LLM (fast path)\n- llm-agent: POST /stream SSE endpoint (Ollama stream:true)\n- llm-agent: vitals prompt now reads raw vital_description/value records,\n  picks most-recent per type, flags CRITICAL readings (temp, BP, HR, SpO2)\n- llm-agent: labs increased from 4 to 6 entries in prompt\n- medication-agent, labs-agent: fix age/gender from patient.demographics\n- ai-insights: generateAnalysis replaced with fetch + ReadableStream;\n  analyzing banner shows live phase messages; rec card appears when agents\n  finish; LLM tokens stream directly into the card with blinking cursor\n- Fix: physician role for DELETE reset route\n- Fix: O2 Saturation Unicode matching in labs-agent","tree":{"sha":"22bcb6fff2fdcc6ef853a98d0c7fc563a065ea63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/22bcb6fff2fdcc6ef853a98d0c7fc563a065ea63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/48edd37e99d26540702baaa3102f2c8a901ef594","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/48edd37e99d26540702baaa3102f2c8a901ef594","node_id":"C_k