lue and unit in publishEvent so escalation rules can evaluate thresholds\n\nlabs-service: add value (req.body.result) and unit (req.body.unit) to labs-resulted event\nvitals-service: add value (newVital.value) and unit (newVital.unit) to vitals-recorded event\n\nPreviously parseFloat(undefined) made every escalation rule return false — no clinical\nnotifications were ever created despite the Comms Agent consumer running correctly.","tree":{"sha":"f1e1a2a3d45ba0d46c56e26ddd58220f1639339a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/f1e1a2a3d45ba0d46c56e26ddd58220f1639339a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/0a48d2c92b2bd5d8502cdb5327e80d4ff87f7e87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/0a48d2c92b2bd5d8502cdb5327e80d4ff87f7e87","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKDBhNDhkMmM5MmIyYmQ1ZDg1MDJjZGI1MzI3ZTgwZDRmZjg3ZjdlODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a","sha":"e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a"}],"sha":"0a48d2c92b2bd5d8502cdb5327e80d4ff87f7e87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/0a48d2c92b2bd5d8502cdb5327e80d4ff87f7e87"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T14:52:37Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T14:52:37Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"docs: overhaul README, system diagrams, and SVG architecture for AI multi-agent and dual-adapter DAL\n\nREADME.md:\n- New headline and 3 badges (Micro-Frontend, AI Multi-Agent, Dual-Adapter DB)\n- ToC entries for AI Multi-Agent System and Dual-Adapter Data Layer\n- Current State updated: all AI agents with correct ports, Redis Streams, dual-adapter DAL\n- Future Vision corrected: agentic AI removed (implemented), replaced with real remaining work\n- New section: AI Multi-Agent System with topology + Redis Streams pipeline ASCII diagrams\n- New section: Dual-Adapter Data Layer with architecture diagram and coverage table\n- Technology Stack: correct AI agent ports, PostgreSQL 16 + Knex + Redis Streams\n- Quick Start: all AI agents and PostgreSQL listed\n- Features: AI Multi-Agent, Real-Time Escalation, Dual-Adapter sections added\n- API Docs: AI recommendation and notification endpoints added\n\ndocs/SYSTEM_DIAGRAMS.md:\n- Fix AI Orchestrator port 5300 -> 5008 with individual agent ports and descriptions\n- Repository pattern transition label: both Knex (PG) and Mongo adapters shown\n- Replace MongoDB-only DB box with dual-adapter section: all 11 PostgreSQL tables + MongoDB collections\n- Replace Redis Pub/Sub section with Redis Streams (XADD/XREADGROUP/XACK, consumer group)\n- Repository Pattern diagram: KnexXxxRepository shown as fully implemented (remove ''future'')\n- Data Flow: MongoDB-direct query replaced with repository adapter call\n- New section: AI Multi-Agent System Topology diagram (orchestrator fan-out, 4 agents, human-in-the-loop)\n- New section: Escalation and Notification Pipeline diagram (stream -> Comms Agent -> rule engine -> bell UI)\n\ndocs/diagrams/system-architecture-v-new.svg:\n- DAL panel: KnexRepository marked active (green) alongside MongoRepository; 11 collections listed\n- Added PostgreSQL 16 box (port 5432, 11 tables) alongside MongoDB box\n- Redis box: named stream patientrecord-events and consumer group comms-agent-group\n- Orchestrator fan-out arrows: added Labs Agent (5010) and LLM Agent (5013) arrows\n- Comms Agent: replaced wrong event names with XREADGROUP/XACK/rule-engine detail\n- Legend: added PostgreSQL 16 entry","tree":{"sha":"e9fc0653173c22ae24e75a336d8a5df51984f84f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/e9fc0653173c22ae24e75a336d8a5df51984f84f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKGU2NWRlOWU2MDQxNWQ4N2JiYjFjZjVkZDNiY2M4ZDkzZGYxZTRiNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99","sha":"ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99"}],"sha":"e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/e65de9e60415d87bbb1cf5dd3bcc8d93df1e4b4a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T14:30:18Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T14:30:18Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"feat: dual-adapter DAL — full PostgreSQL support alongside MongoDB\n\n## Repository Pattern — Database Adapter Layer (complete)\n\nAll services now support switching between MongoDB and PostgreSQL via\na single environment variable:\n\n  DB_ADAPTER=knex   -> PostgreSQL via Knex (production default)\n  DB_ADAPTER=mongo  -> MongoDB via Mongoose (zero code change to revert)\n\n### Shared infrastructure\n- backend/shared/db/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql\n  New tables: patients, vitals, labs, medications, visits,\n  care_team_members, clinical_notes, registry,\n  ai_recommendations, notifications, ai_audit_log\n- backend/shared/db/knexClient.js — shared Knex instance\n- backend/shared/repositories/repositoryFactory.js\n  Both mongo and knex adapter maps, including registry\n\n### New Knex adapters (backend/shared/repositories/adapters/knex/)\n  KnexPatientRepository, KnexVitalsRepository, KnexLabsRepository,\n  KnexMedicationsRepository, KnexVisitsRepository,\n  KnexCareTeamRepository, KnexClinicalNotesRepository,\n  KnexRegistryRepository\n\n### New Mongo adapters\n  MongoRegistryRepository — registry-service now uses factory pattern\n\n### Service changes (all 10 affected services)\n- mongoose.connect() wrapped in DB_ADAPTER !== ''knex'' guard\n  (prevents crash when Mongo is stopped/unavailable)\n- process.exit(1) on Mongo failure only fires in mongo adapter mode\n- knex + pg added to package.json for services that needed it\n\n### ai-orchestrator (approvalStore.js + server.js)\n- approvalStore.js: dual-path Knex/Mongoose; maps PG rows to\n  existing camelCase API shape (_id, patientId, llmSummary, etc.)\n- Knex path: ai_recommendations table; immutable status enforced in SQL\n\n### comms-agent (notificationStore.js + server.js)\n- notificationStore.js: dual-path for Notification + AuditLog models\n- Dedup window query translated to SQL (WHERE created_at >= cutoff)\n- Idempotency: Postgres 23505 unique_violation handled same as Mongo E11000\n- Redis Streams consumer starts immediately in knex mode (no Mongo wait)\n\n### Registry service\n- Full factory-pattern rewrite (was inline Mongoose); seeds on startup\n- Dockerfile: context changed to ./backend to include shared/ at build time\n- registry.json path: candidate-path resolution for local dev + Docker\n\n### docker-compose.yml\n- All 10 services: DB_ADAPTER, DATABASE_URL env vars added\n- depends_on: patientrecord-postgres replaces patientrecord-mongodb\n  for services that now run on Knex\n- patientrecord-registry-service: Dockerfile path updated\n\n### Documentation updated\n- docs/REALTIME_STATUS.md — correct AI port (5008), all AI agents listed,\n  PostgreSQL added to infrastructure, DB_ADAPTER usage documented\n- docs/SYSTEM_DIAGRAMS.md — Current System State table updated, date bumped\n- docs/PHASE_8_TODO.md — 8.4/8.5/8.6 marked complete (54/82 tasks done)\n- docs/DATA_ACCESS_LAYER_PLAN.md — Phases 5+6 added (Knex adapters, AI stores)\n\nTested: both DB_ADAPTER=mongo and DB_ADAPTER=knex validated end-to-end\nwith MongoDB stopped (knex) and PostgreSQL bypassed (mongo).","tree":{"sha":"00683f5440e9239c1839a656f5d7d446bb8b6c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/00683f5440e9239c1839a656f5d7d446bb8b6c0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKGVlN2YyYjNkMmZjZGEzNTJhMjY1ZjQxZTk3Yzg2MWRkZDIxMmVmOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0","sha":"6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0"}],"sha":"ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/ee7f2b3d2fcda352a265f41e97c861ddd212ef99"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-27T14:16:19Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-27T14:16:19Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"fix(docker): add shared/ copy and symlink to service Dockerfiles, fix patient-service build context\n\n- Add ''COPY shared/ ./shared/'' and ''RUN ln -s /app/shared /shared'' to\n  vitals, labs, medications, visits, care-team, and clinical-notes service\n  Dockerfiles to resolve MODULE_NOT_FOUND for repositoryFactory\n- Add missing ''COPY shared/'' step to patient-service and clinical-notes-service\n  which previously had no shared directory copy at all\n- Update patient-service build context in docker-compose.yml from\n  ./backend/services/patient-service to ./backend so Dockerfile can\n  access the shared/ directory during build","tree":{"sha":"fcdb86e8cfd19dd6b422925f0d7b31a3682af54e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/fcdb86e8cfd19dd6b422925f0d7b31a3682af54e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKDZmMDA5MDM1MTE1YmUyZmRiNDkxYmM2ZjZlMGRmY2VjMDE3YmE3YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/6187290f41cf4a3e7c20ecec860cda62160f0a87","sha":"6187290f41cf4a3e7c20ecec860cda62160f0a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/6187290f41cf4a3e7c20ecec860cda62160f0a87"}],"sha":"6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/6f009035115be2fdb491bc6f6e0dfcec017ba7b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/6187290f41cf4a3e7c20ecec860cda62160f0a87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-26T16:05:19Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"com