s.js: 32 clinically significant drug-drug interaction pairs\n    (anticoagulants, ACE inhibitors, statins, serotonergic, digoxin, QT-prolonging, methotrexate)\n- rules/contraindications.js: allergy substance -> drug class contraindication map\n    (penicillin, cephalosporin, sulfa, aspirin/NSAID, codeine, morphine, contrast)\n- analyzer.js: orchestrates all 4 rules; handles {value:[]} or [] response shapes\n- server.js: POST /analyze (internal only, no auth), GET /health, port 5009\n- Renal dose adjustment: 12 renally-cleared drugs flagged vs most-recent creatinine\n- Duplicate therapy: 15 drug class groups; flags concurrent same-class prescribing\n- Wire into ai-orchestrator/server.js: callAgent() fail-soft helper, parallel fan-out\n- Add MEDICATION_AGENT_URL env to ai-orchestrator in docker-compose\n- patientrecord-medication-agent: internal service, no exposed port\n- Update PHASE_8_TODO.md: 8.3.1-8.3.8 complete (26/82)\n\nTest (patient 20002, Warfarin+Aspirin+Metformin+Lisinopril, Cr=2.4 mg/dL):\n  4 findings: drug-interaction[high], renal x2[high/moderate], duplicate-therapy[moderate]","tree":{"sha":"e9e909f49b316d18f2351fa42fb925e3daff06fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/e9e909f49b316d18f2351fa42fb925e3daff06fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/40550521773c06e1bbdc6ffb0242abe288be472f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/40550521773c06e1bbdc6ffb0242abe288be472f","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKDQwNTUwNTIxNzczYzA2ZTFiYmRjNmZmYjAyNDJhYmUyODhiZTQ3MmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/88500d1782d770f62a82108d9e0bb26266b4ef67","sha":"88500d1782d770f62a82108d9e0bb26266b4ef67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/88500d1782d770f62a82108d9e0bb26266b4ef67"}],"sha":"