rrect row (Registry with other services)\n  - MongoDB with all collections\n  - Full port legend\n  - Fixed: removed UTF-8 BOM and CSS drop-shadow filters for VS Code rendering","tree":{"sha":"a02e2ac2060f45cdb8e7c414a10d22205d99370c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/a02e2ac2060f45cdb8e7c414a10d22205d99370c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/8daf78fcaa6d982301386d1a801c57c2b1196bff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/8daf78fcaa6d982301386d1a801c57c2b1196bff","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKDhkYWY3OGZjYWE2ZDk4MjMwMTM4NmQxYTgwMWM1N2MyYjExOTZiZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e","sha":"9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e"}],"sha":"8daf78fcaa6d982301386d1a801c57c2b1196bff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/8daf78fcaa6d982301386d1a801c57c2b1196bff"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T18:55:23Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T18:55:23Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"feat(phase-4): admin dashboard, role editor, all 7 module routes wired\n\n- admin.guard.ts: CanActivateFn requiring role=admin\n- AdminDashboardComponent: service health grid + module enable/disable toggles\n  + inline role multiselect editor (admin/physician/nurse) with save/cancel\n- PluginRegistryService: getAllModulesAdmin(), toggleModuleRemote(), updateModuleRoles()\n- /admin route guarded by authGuard + adminGuard\n- SideNavigationComponent: userRole input + admin panel button (admin-only)\n- Added visits, care-team, procedures routes to bootstrap.ts\n- Added visitsApp, careTeamApp webpack remotes to shell webpack.config.js\n- ProceduresWrapperComponent: Angular->React MF bridge via loadRemoteModule(type:script)\n- Fix: procedures-react nginx listen 4200 (was 4207, caused MF boot crash)\n- Fix: frontend/.gitignore -- allow webpack.config.js and jest config files\n- Add all module webpack.config.js files to source control","tree":{"sha":"95f591f134424078c132e412bf80aa2bbec8d682","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/95f591f134424078c132e412bf80aa2bbec8d682"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKDliZTM0MWIwZTViZDJmOGQ5YWFlYjc1NWE1YmEyMjFiNDQxYzNlMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081","sha":"f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081"}],"sha":"9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/9be341b0e5bd2f8d9aaeb755a5ba221b441c3e0e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T15:39:41Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T15:39:41Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"feat(phase-3): robustness, observability, and UX hardening\n\n- Add Docker healthchecks (wget /health) to all 9 microservices\n- Add restart: unless-stopped to all services and frontend containers\n- Upgrade all depends_on from service_started to service_healthy\n- Add gateway /health/deep endpoint fanning out to all 8 upstream services\n- Add structured JSON request logging to all 8 microservices\n- Add scripts/smoke-test.js: 36 assertions covering all routes end-to-end\n- Add Swagger UI at GET /api-docs on the API gateway (port 5000)\n- Fix nginx shell container: use set \\ variable so DNS re-resolves\n  on each request, eliminating 502s after gateway rebuilds\n- Fix module-availability guard: replace hardcoded ''nurse'' role with real\n  role from AuthService; add functional moduleAvailabilityGuard export\n- Apply moduleAvailabilityGuard to all dashboard child routes in bootstrap.ts\n  so disabled modules are blocked on direct URL navigation\n- Handle non-existent patient IDs on deep links: show red error banner and\n  suppress module viewport instead of rendering a broken module","tree":{"sha":"07aff38cabf948a1459dcc37e32db452f64f333a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/07aff38cabf948a1459dcc37e32db452f64f333a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKGY4ZTQ4OTA1MmRmM2RjNWI0OWY1ODdkYTZiOGQ0YzcwY2JjM2IwODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a","sha":"d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a"}],"sha":"f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/f8e489052df3dc5b49f587da6b8d4c70cbc3b081"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T14:22:30Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T14:22:30Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"feat(phase-2): extract clinical domain services + decommission monolith\n\n- vitals-service (port 5003) - GET/POST /api/patients/:id/vitals\n- labs-service (port 5004) - GET/POST /api/patients/:id/labs\n- medications-service (port 5005) - GET/POST /api/patients/:id/medications|meds\n- visits-service (port 5006) - GET/POST /api/patients/:id/visits\n- care-team-service (port 5007) - GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/patients/:id/care-team\n- Update gateway: route sub-resource paths to dedicated clinical services\n- Decommission monolith: remove patientrecord-backend from docker-compose\n- Replace gateway catch-all proxy with 404 handler (no more monolith)\n- Remove BACKEND_URL from gateway and docker-compose\n- Update all frontend depends_on from backend to api-gateway\n- Fix nginx.conf: use variable proxy_pass for dynamic DNS resolution","tree":{"sha":"d4aeccff0685c0c6470b2320b53f0c70e08d799c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/d4aeccff0685c0c6470b2320b53f0c70e08d799c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9J4h9oAKGQwYjU4ZTE2ZDEyYWYwMjZhMTE2OTg1NTZiNDUwODc5OTY2OTEwMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/a6b7b7f41ea5566a3efa24165ff2f407eb37a236","sha":"a6b7b7f41ea5566a3efa24165ff2f407eb37a236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/a6b7b7f41ea5566a3efa24165ff2f407eb37a236"}],"sha":"d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/d0b58e16d12af026a11698556b4508799669101a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commits/a6b7b7f41ea5566a3efa24165ff2f407eb37a236/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T13:39:14Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T13:39:14Z","email":"dev@patientrecords.local","name":"Development Team"},"message":"feat(phase-1): add API Gateway + Auth, Patient, Registry microservices\n\n- Phase 1a: API Gateway (port 5000) as smart routing proxy\n- Phase 1b.1: Auth Service (port 5001) - stateless JWT login/refresh/validate\n- Phase 1b.2: Patient Service (port 5002) - all patient CRUD + vitals/labs/meds/visits/care-team\n- Phase 1b.3: Registry Service (port 5100) - module registry + admin CRUD\n- Gateway routes /api/auth->5001, /api/patients->5002, /api/registry->5100, catch-all->8001\n- Remove auth routes from monolith (backend/server.js)\n- Update all frontend URLs from :8001 to :5000 (nginx, config.service, 6 interceptors, 6 components)\n- Update docker-compose to include all 4 new services","tree":{"sha":"abfec8ef48eab41559bd76690abb1476d5dc36b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/trees/abfec8ef48eab41559bd76690abb1476d5dc36b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/git/commits/a6b7b7f41ea5566a3efa24165ff2f407eb37a236","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/sultanj-pro/PatientRecords/commit/a6b7b7f41