ithubusercontent.com/u/142177584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phoenixdahdev","id":142177584,"login":"phoenixdahdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCHl1MA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prudentbird/beakcrypt/commits/33505ff6f2e9ad3ade9fabee285564bae4f182ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T10:31:52Z","email":"ayomikuntemitope.araoye@gmail.com","name":"phoenixdahdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T10:32:51Z","email":"ayomikuntemitope.araoye@gmail.com","name":"phoenixdahdev"},"message":"feat: add Beakcrypt CLI for terminal-based secret management\n\nExtract crypto functions into a shared `@beakcrypt/crypto` package so both\nthe web app and CLI can reuse the same RSA-OAEP + AES-256-GCM encryption\nlogic. The web app''s `crypto.ts` now re-exports from the shared package\nand retains only the localStorage helpers.\n\nScaffold the CLI as `packages/cli/` (published as `beakcrypt` on npm) with\ntsup bundling to a single ESM entry point targeting Node 20. The CLI\nimplements the full secret management workflow:\n\n- Authentication via browser-based GitHub OAuth flow with a local HTTP\n  callback server. A new `/auth/cli` route in the web app handles the\n  handoff, and an API route extracts the HttpOnly session token for the\n  CLI. Credentials are stored in `~/.beakcrypt/auth.json`.\n\n- Project linking via `beakcrypt link`, which creates a `.beakcrypt/`\n  directory (auto-gitignored) with `project.json` containing org, project,\n  and default environment references. Context resolution walks up from cwd\n  to find the config, with CLI flags taking priority.\n\n- Device key management mirroring the web app''s flow: generates RSA-4096\n  key pairs, registers them via the Convex `keys.registerKey` mutation,\n  polls for admin approval if needed, and stores keys at\n  `~/.beakcrypt/keys/{orgId}.json` with 0600 permissions.\n\n- Core commands: `pull` (decrypt secrets to .env file), `push` (encrypt\n  and upload from .env file), `run` (inject secrets into a child process),\n  `secrets list|set|remove|clear`, `org list`, `env list`.\n\n- Interactive mode when run with no arguments, guiding users through\n  login, linking, and common actions via prompts.\n\nMonorepo integration: add `dist/**` to turbo build outputs, add\n`build:cli` and `dev:cli` root scripts, add `.beakcrypt` to root\n`.gitignore`.","tree":{"sha":"c09fd0c50bdc0ff23349e25fe8aa3ffa68673c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prudentbird/beakcrypt/git/trees/c09fd0c50bdc0ff23349e25fe8aa3ffa68673c6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prudentbird/beakcrypt/git/commits/33505ff6f2e9ad3ade9fabee285564bae4f182ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142177584?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phoenixdahdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phoen