","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/ea92acf08024d02458c2c2833054c4ca01e411da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:23:59Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:23:59Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"message":"feat: rename app to \"Lei em Voz\"\n\nRenames the product from \"Audio Law\" everywhere it was purely a label\nwith no design implications: FastAPI title, package.json name, HTML\ntitle, and the root README.","tree":{"sha":"c053ae04d0162e74d847d516eef0d92e5d2cf9fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/trees/c053ae04d0162e74d847d516eef0d92e5d2cf9fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/commits/ea92acf08024d02458c2c2833054c4ca01e411da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/ea92acf08024d02458c2c2833054c4ca01e411da","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9K0_9oAKGVhOTJhY2YwODAyNGQwMjQ1OGMyYzI4MzMwNTRjNGNhMDFlNDExZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349","sha":"a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349"}],"sha":"ea92acf08024d02458c2c2833054c4ca01e411da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/ea92acf08024d02458c2c2833054c4ca01e411da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:14:13Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:14:13Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"message":"feat: support multiple simultaneous file conversions with per-file cards\n\nUsePage tracked a single job at a time, so converting more than one PDF\nhad no visual separation between which audio belonged to which file.\nAdd useJobsList (a small localStorage-backed list of {jobId, fileName}\nthat survives a reload) and JobCard (owns its own polling via\nuseJobPolling, and renders the file name, a StatusBadge, progress, and\nthat job''s segments as one self-contained block). UsePage now renders\na stack of JobCard''s, most recent first, instead of a single status\npanel. StatsGrid is removed — it showed generic global counts that\ndon''t make sense once there can be several files in flight; segment\ncounts now live per-card in JobStatusPanel''s caption.","tree":{"sha":"5f322e26fbee0f52e07b8a91cf1329be787ed43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/trees/5f322e26fbee0f52e07b8a91cf1329be787ed43f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/commits/a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9K0_9oAKGE3YTM1N2E0YzVmODFjNTE2NGNmNzNmNTZjYTU2Zjk5NWRiNzQzNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7","sha":"0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7"}],"sha":"a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/a7a357a4c5f81c5164cf73f56ca56f995db74349"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:14:03Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:14:03Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"message":"feat: compute real conversion progress from completed segments\n\nReplace the flat STATUS_PROGRESS map (processing was always a fixed\n55%, regardless of actual work done) with computeProgress(), which\nscales within the processing phase using segmentsReady/totalSegments\nfrom the backend''s now-incremental job response. JobStatusPanel''s\ncaption also reports \"X de Y trechos prontos\" instead of a generic\nmessage.","tree":{"sha":"91f7fadb9223c89fe29c95bce5ae767059d0b30c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/trees/91f7fadb9223c89fe29c95bce5ae767059d0b30c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/commits/0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9K0_9oAKDAzNDU1MzljNmQxOTZiZmUzNGVhNDlkODI3NzA4NjQ0Y2ZlMDEzZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae","sha":"8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae"}],"sha":"0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/0345539c6d196bfe34ea49d827708644cfe013e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:13:55Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:13:55Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"message":"feat: stream job segments incrementally instead of waiting for completion\n\nPreviously the pipeline built every segment in memory and the job store\nonly got a result once the whole document had finished converting, so\nlong PDFs looked stuck for minutes with no feedback. The pipeline now\ntakes on_text_ready/on_segment_ready callbacks and fires them as soon\nas the text is cleaned/segmented and as each segment''s audio is\ngenerated; the API wires those callbacks to new JobStore methods\n(init_result, add_segment) so GET /api/jobs/{id} returns segments as\nthey land, plus a total_segments count for computing real progress.","tree":{"sha":"9aa717feb28e8e8f05da8ee42f056fcc85b9e5d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/trees/9aa717feb28e8e8f05da8ee42f056fcc85b9e5d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/commits/8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9K0_9oAKDhjZmJjNDc5NjY4NDZjYjVhNDZhOWZkZGEzOTFlZjk0Yjc1YmQ2YWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b","sha":"34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b"}],"sha":"8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/8cfbc47966846cb5a46a9fdda391ef94b75bd6ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:13:46Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T02:13:46Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"message":"fix: convert roman numeral incisos and headings to spoken ordinals\n\nBrazilian legal text is full of roman-numeral list markers (\"I - ...\",\n\"II - ...\") and headings (\"TÍTULO IV\", \"SEÇÃO II\"), and none of that\nwas being converted before hitting Azure TTS — the engine sounded out\nthe letters instead (\"í\", \"vê\"...). Add a roman-to-integer parser and a\nPortuguese ordinal-word table, and apply it to inciso markers and\nTÍTULO/SEÇÃO/LIVRO/PARTE headings.\n\nCAPÍTULO is deliberately left untouched: split_text_by_chapters() still\nneeds the literal \"CAPÍTULO <roman>\" pattern to detect chapters, and\nthat heading is only ever used as a segment title, never sent to TTS,\nso converting it would break segmentation for no audible benefit.","tree":{"sha":"90542da3ec770c410e4c3292f324542116ff2836","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/trees/90542da3ec770c410e4c3292f324542116ff2836"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/commits/34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9K0_9oAKDM0YTJkZDY1ZWE5MjEzNjExZjNiMTUzYWI5ODViMDYyMGY4MGNlOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/9eace9c29036e4d1b7bc0b643f6be44f2c25e086","sha":"9eace9c29036e4d1b7bc0b643f6be44f2c25e086","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/9eace9c29036e4d1b7bc0b643f6be44f2c25e086"}],"sha":"34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/34a2dd65ea9213611f3b153ab985b0620f80ce9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commits/9eace9c29036e4d1b7bc0b643f6be44f2c25e086/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:39:57Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T13:39:57Z","email":"pedrofernandes.olv@gmail.com","name":"Pedro Fernandes"},"message":"fix: resolve nginx /api/ upstream lazily to avoid boot crash\n\nproxy_pass with a plain hostname is resolved at config-load time, so\nnginx refused to start at all when \"backend\" wasn''t a resolvable host\n(e.g. deployed as a standalone Railway service, where the frontend\ntalks to the backend directly via VITE_API_BASE_URL and never needs\nthis proxy). Using a variable + resolver defers resolution to request\ntime, so a missing \"backend\" host just 502s that one route instead of\ncrash-looping the whole container.","tree":{"sha":"de0bf3a3248f9db86ea1dc1a22f4efbbe22caea9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/trees/de0bf3a3248f9db86ea1dc1a22f4efbbe22caea9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/commits/9eace9c29036e4d1b7bc0b643f6be44f2c25e086","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pe