ing\n  back to dark), persists changes, and toggles the `dark`/`light`\n  class + data-theme attribute on <html>.\n- index.css: Tailwind entrypoint plus the light/dark color tokens and\n  the scroll-reveal / hero letter-reveal animation primitives used by\n  the redesigned pages, with a prefers-reduced-motion escape hatch.\n- main.jsx now wraps the app in ThemeProvider.","tree":{"sha":"c343cd4e2c96bb86b3e90ec5a5cfad55bc0f3509","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/trees/c343cd4e2c96bb86b3e90ec5a5cfad55bc0f3509"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/git/commits/c8f5948c5ee25330c8580d45455ffba9b3919609","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82961047?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss","id":82961047,"login":"pedrofernandss","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyOTYxMDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pedrofernandss","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pedrofernandss/law-in-voice/commit/c8f5948c5ee25330c8580d45455ffba9b3919609","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9K0_9oAKGM4ZjU5NDhjNWVlMjUzMzBjODU4MGQ0NTQ1NWZmYmE5YjM5MTk2MDk","parents":[{"html_ur