eated CorsConfig.java with global CORS filter\n- Allows requests from localhost:3000, localhost:5173, and all localhost ports\n- Removed @CrossOrigin annotations from all controllers\n- Configured proper headers and credentials support\n\nCORS Headers Now Include:\n- Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:3000\n- Access-Control-Allow-Credentials: true\n- Access-Control-Expose-Headers: Authorization, Content-Type, X-Total-Count\n- Supports all HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE, OPTIONS, PATCH)\n\nTested and verified working through:\n- Direct backend access (localhost:9091-9093)\n- NGINX load balancer (localhost:80)","tree":{"sha":"aabbb7a07d7a5b7e49b4189676c5918179b8c994","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaborgium00106/learn_social_media_service/git/trees/aabbb7a07d7a5b7e49b4189676c5918179b8c994"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaborgium00106/learn_social_media_service/git/commits/0c0e1a7ffc651c94b8196d786d926a83d9b9de4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98204410?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fancyhe1","id":98204410,"login":"Fancyhe1","node_id":"U_kgDOBdp6-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1","user_view_type":"public"},