message":"Dockerize frontend and add production compose override\n\nFeatures:\n- Created multi-stage Dockerfile for frontend (dev + prod modes)\n- Development mode: Vite dev server with HMR and hot reload\n- Production mode: Static file serving with ''serve''\n- Added frontend service to docker-compose.yml\n- Created docker-compose.prod.yml for production overrides\n- Updated vite.config.ts with Docker-compatible server config\n- Added frontend/.dockerignore with appropriate exclusions\n- Updated .env.example with frontend environment variables\n- Fixed TypeScript errors in frontend code:\n  - Removed unused Chip import from TimelinePost\n  - Added userId prop to PostForm in HomePage\n  - Removed unused useUIStore import from UserProfilePage\n\nFrontend can now run in containers:\n- Development: http://localhost:3000 with hot reload\n- Production: http://localhost:3000 serving optimized build\n- Both modes communicate with backend via NGINX load balancer (http://localhost)\n\nVolume mounts enable live code editing in development mode.","tree":{"sha":"bd4a47ab40ee4fc41c762df2a466db3532b5f6ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaborgium00106/learn_social_media_service/git/trees/bd4a47ab40ee4fc41c762df2a466db3532b5f6ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/seaborgium00106/learn_social_media_service/git/commits/b6d7046cf82170bd73984e370aebaae51744ab94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98204410?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fancyhe1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Fancyhe1","id":98204410,"login":"Fancyhe1","node_id":"U_kgDOBdp6-g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.