natadeo@hotmail.com","name":"BinaryJack"},"message":"fix(insert): array reactive expressions properly clear previous DOM nodes on re-render\n\nRoot cause: the reactive insert effect tracked a single ''current: Node | undefined''.\nWhen the accessor returned an array, ''current'' was set to undefined after the first\nrender. On every subsequent signal update, e.parentNode was null so old nodes were\nNEVER removed — new nodes just piled up (spray bug).\n\nFix: replace single ''current'' with ''currentNodes: Node[]'' that tracks ALL inserted\nnodes across string/Node/Array renders. clearCurrent() removes every tracked node\nbefore each re-run. trackInsert() inserts + pushes to the tracking array.\n\nText/single-Node optimisations preserved:\n- Text: reuse existing Text node if it is the sole current node (avoids churn)\n- Node: no-op if same node already present\n\nFixes:\n- {() => arr.map(...)} spray: appended N copies per signal update → now clears first\n- {() => arr.filter(...)} delete: old nodes stayed in DOM → now properly removed","tree":{"sha":"59e944a60ece0c9c8516f9c23a9f0c9fb63effab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binaryjack/synetics.dev/git/trees/59e944a60ece0c9c8516f9c23a9f0c9fb63effab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binaryjack/synetics.dev/git/commits/afee98bafcb9a4067707de89fb7c8246f5adb017","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1678563?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryjack/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryjack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryjack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryjack/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binaryjack","id":1678563,"login":"binaryjack","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Nzg1NjM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binaryjack/