:36Z","email":"h.ogawa@pntwhere.com","name":"ogawa-where"},"message":"Add ItineraryDisplay component for detailed travel plan view\n\nNew features:\n- ItineraryDisplay component: Shows full itinerary with days, items, accommodations\n  - Day-by-day view with themes\n  - Time slots with POI details\n  - Travel info between locations\n  - Accommodation display\n  - Highlights and budget estimate\n\nEnhancements:\n- TravelSidebar: Toggle to show/hide itinerary, visual score bars\n- api.ts: Add typed interfaces for POI, ItineraryItem, DayPlan, Itinerary\n\nBug fixes:\n- Remove unused props variable warnings in AppHeader and PreferenceSidebar\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"240c8edd5b4b85e69d1ea44422b728a483efd78f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/trees/240c8edd5b4b85e69d1ea44422b728a483efd78f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/commits/0be19a5ae77a9a98c4626148ca9433cb533ff067","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253640723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where","id":253640723,"login":"ogawa-where","node_id":"U_kgDODx5AEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/subscriptions","type":"Us