validation\n\nSummarizer Agent (4 tests):\n- Empty message handling\n- Message summarization\n- Existing summary integration\n- Message sorting by turn index\n\nPreferenceLearner Agent (12 tests):\n- Question generation with/without context\n- Signal extraction and validation\n- Invalid category handling\n- Weight clamping (0-1 range)\n- Profile summary updates\n- Initial greeting generation\n\nProfileUpdater Agent (10 tests):\n- Profile consolidation\n- Duplicate signal removal\n- Feedback integration\n- Signal formatting\n- Result validation\n\nTotal: 295 tests (+43 new tests)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d81177096a0bccde04b60bb38fc5375dc8eb7934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/trees/d81177096a0bccde04b60bb38fc5375dc8eb7934"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/commits/7fe64a9de364e3a0c71669f0d04a8ffb88d9655e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253640723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where","id":253640723,"login":"ogawa-where","node_id":"U_kgDODx5AEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where","user_v