ator to store artifacts at each step:\n  - Request JSON, structured request, selected POIs, plan, rationale\n\n- Add 23 observability tests covering:\n  - Step context tracking\n  - Metrics collection and accumulation\n  - Artifact storage and retrieval\n  - Trace structure validation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4bb494e182f94e5ffb41ecc7e2692217d6d3076d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/trees/4bb494e182f94e5ffb41ecc7e2692217d6d3076d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/commits/5c480fca48eb47ecb0463c83ec7773bdb02f26bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253640723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where","id":253640723,"login":"ogawa-where","node_id":"U_kgDODx5AEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/commit/5c480fca48eb47ecb0463c83ec7773bdb02f26bb","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9ibwNoAKDVjNDgwZmNhNDhlYjQ3ZWNiMDQ2M2M4M2VjNzc3M2JkYjAyZjI2YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/commit/b06979cf1885