ndex logic (user starts new turn)\n   - Message summarization identification\n   - Context structure for LLM calls\n\n3. Search result normalization/deduplication (24 tests)\n   - Name normalization (spaces, brackets, length)\n   - Location normalization (postal code removal)\n   - Description normalization (HTML removal)\n   - Tag deduplication\n   - POI deduplication (by name similarity, URL)\n   - Score-based duplicate resolution\n\n4. Long-term memory (11 tests) [existing]\n   - Signal consolidation\n   - Weight validation\n   - Memory preservation\n\nTotal: 72 tests, all passing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f48f5f38f5b0828747b9236b4a1a077087fcf2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/trees/9f48f5f38f5b0828747b9236b4a1a077087fcf2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/commits/bd60c8d72ad2ca51f3f7f85c662d66c180e2d3ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253640723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where","id":253640723,"login":"ogawa-where","node_id":"U_kgDODx5AEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where","u