plement long-term memory feature (長期記憶)\n\nCLAUDE.md section 5.2に基づく長期記憶機能の実装:\n\nBackend:\n- Profile Updater Agent: HEAVYティアモデルを使用した長期記憶更新\n- Long-term Memory Service: シグナルの統合・重複排除・上限管理\n- API endpoints: /api/preference/learning/complete, /api/preference/memory/consolidate\n- Travel feedback endpoint: /api/travel/feedback\n- Tests for long-term memory logic\n\nFrontend:\n- 学習完了ボタン（嗜好シグナルの統合・整理）\n- 旅行プランへのフィードバックUI\n\nFeatures:\n- 2層構造の長期記憶（プロフィール要約 + 構造化シグナル）\n- 嗜好シグナルの自動統合・重複排除\n- 低重みシグナルの自動削除\n- シグナル数上限（30件）の強制\n- 旅行プランへのフィードバックから嗜好学習\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5c55ec66cb55412d9117201cf4ac6c1d1f698c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/trees/c5c55ec66cb55412d9117201cf4ac6c1d1f698c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/commits/95495acc7a0b12cbb13e0eff48aa246de90d4a3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253640723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where","id":253640723,"login":"ogawa-where","node_id":"U_kgDODx5AEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi