s x3: activity, food, hotel (parallel execution)\n- Normalizer/Deduper for POI processing\n- Rerank Agent: embedding-based preference matching\n- Planner Agent: itinerary generation with scoring\n- Explainer Agent: rationale generation\n- Orchestrator: full flow management with tracing\n- API endpoints for travel planning chat\n\nFrontend:\n- Mode switcher (preference learning / travel planning)\n- Travel planning chat UI\n- Plan summary sidebar\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dfa90834e708f18b74fe5c48a9a067b8e36dcf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/trees/0dfa90834e708f18b74fe5c48a9a067b8e36dcf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/git/commits/0c8d0637e7a5e66b8d8f75222ac19cd85c494522","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253640723?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where","id":253640723,"login":"ogawa-where","node_id":"U_kgDODx5AEw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ogawa-where","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ogawa-where/travel-ai-agent/commit/0c8d0637e7a5e66b8d8f75222ac19cd85c494522","node_id