tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/commits/748fc512befe96389d881f5b303cc148c63cf210/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T20:37:41Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T20:37:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve all 11 E2E test failures\n\n1. Dismiss onboarding modal via API before page navigation in loginByApi helper.\n   The OnboardingGuideDialog was showing on first login (guide_seen_at=null)\n   with a z-50 overlay that intercepted all click events. This caused\n   failures in: logout, navigate to documents, create document, view\n   document details, versions tab, attachments tab, comments tab, add comment.\n\n2. Fix password label: change <span> to <label htmlFor=\"password\"> in\n   LoginPage.tsx so the \"forms have proper labels\" test can find\n   label[for=\"password\"].\n\n3. Fix keyboard navigation test: use .focus() instead of Tab to reach\n   username field (headless Chromium Tab behavior varies), and add extra\n   Tab press for the remember-me checkbox between password and submit.\n\n4. Fix status filter test: change getByRole(''button'') to\n   getByRole(''menuitemradio'') since the Published option uses\n   role=\"menuitemradio\" in DocumentsFiltersToolbar.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/sessions/7278bcd5-b1ef-4db5-bf24-bb6b2663b683\n\nCo-authored-by: Yogevso <156666724+Yogevso@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"80c82775498ff4532e28cc9b0be718e38d03994b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/git/trees/80c82775498ff4532e28cc9b0be718e38d03994b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/git/commits/748fc512befe96389d881f5b303cc148c63cf210","verification":{"payload":"tree 80c82775498ff4532e28cc9b0be718e38d03994b\nparent 27c686b981b7c5a24314c5e06d407dbd372b035b\nauthor copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1776285461 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776285461 +0000\n\nfix: resolve all 11 E2E test failures\n\n1. Dismiss onboarding modal via API before page navigation in loginByApi helper.\n   The OnboardingGuideDialog was showing on first login (guide_seen_at=null)\n   with a z-50 overlay that intercepted all click events. This caused\n   failures in: logout, navigate to documents, create document, view\n   document details, versions tab, attachments tab, comments tab, add comment.\n\n2. Fix password label: change <span> to <label htmlFor=\"password\"> in\n   LoginPage.tsx so the \"forms have proper labels\" test can find\n   label[for=\"password\"].\n\n3. Fix keyboard navigation test: use .focus() instead of Tab to reach\n   username field (headless Chromium Tab behavior varies), and add extra\n   Tab press for the remember-me checkbox between password and submit.\n\n4. Fix status filter test: change getByRole(''button'') to\n   getByRole(''menuitemradio'') since the Published option uses\n   role=\"menuitemradio\" in DocumentsFiltersToolbar.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/sessions/7278bcd5-b1ef-4db5-bf24-bb6b2663b683\n\nCo-authored-by: Yogevso <156666724+Yogevso@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3/cWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUF4QAGGo7mUWqCwDb7WhueSB+1gZ\nTY8hKq7MqQQkvtgsP+QJezgvwNpyDcxS0txIsYpxuPxs5mDINIew7tyEdZBQ2+DK\nmG8Glv0XJh9IOK90578g0/GokAEYTBkdo6QiS50oD0egU9jgbxCMfzKi5mkP8G18\nRDd/rF5SIZr1Fs+JX5Cq2ltNGu2rIg41pkrVvIj8mNQ179ZdBp+HzrZqM80w1gre\nHzVuPFCVHgtXSnTwnHat1hZ2Z92cWI1VGqjtSgsW3TGhrMnE2uPYlLR4DpIEXmNm\nChcNyVTHNHSmWt9glz6WsAKlXRVedwAui22BGjpEu55EUHtLgRCFmDjwGFShGQDh\ns7fnAyo2UVYux2tC1NgEEJny2k5k8PO+wEfNjgZxcNqYkm8Hmnilq0f+6deTfuNV\nerswdYH5NByV1oj4PtmGU5Sp/1ByE7VIYnWyimxZ1NLeDwraSxIAcUnyVmlP/AQp\nlR4jw9xA5OCrutUKh8yzeF2pJr2168OhWK6c4lpCHda7hF8Dj16bZLx/KZtI07kI\n1Z3qn9JdypVjuxkAEZ843j5LlWtgYtyfn88Tnz3efAN9FgIsEhe/oM2G9R3NWIwV\nUPn7YnSMp0VrCpBPkeoBcLKNhxLnncWsLUiEK8ElWA6EA4FVhi7G7iB6duiMhGj2\nLL85Di7uRYwgijpeTeAl\n=oy2J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-15T20:37:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/commit/748fc512befe96389d881f5b303cc148c63cf210","node_id":"C_kwDOQ9kaMNoAKDc0OGZjNTEyYmVmZTk2Mzg5ZDg4MWY1YjMwM2NjMTQ4YzYzY2YyMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/commit/27c686b981b7c5a24314c5e06d407dbd372b035b","sha":"27c686b981b7c5a24314c5e06d407dbd372b035b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/commits/27c686b981b7c5a24314c5e06d407dbd372b035b"}],"sha":"748fc512befe96389d881f5b303cc148c63cf210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/commits/748fc512befe96389d881f5b303cc148c63cf210"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","id":198982749,"login":"Copilot","node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/commits/27c686b981b7c5a24314c5e06d407dbd372b035b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T20:21:36Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T20:21:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve perf gate file paths to absolute and add E2E timeouts\n\nThe Performance Regression Gates job was failing because run_backend_perf_gate.py\nreceived relative paths (e.g. backend/perf-gate-results.xml) but pytest runs from\nBACKEND_DIR, so the JUnit XML was written to backend/backend/perf-gate-results.xml\nwhile the script tried to read from backend/perf-gate-results.xml.\n\nFix: resolve paths to absolute before use.\n\nAlso adds timeout-minutes: 20 to all E2E test jobs to prevent indefinite hangs.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/sessions/907fba91-c67c-4af6-be1a-e13d198d92ef\n\nCo-authored-by: Yogevso <156666724+Yogevso@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fc6e87597f6ea806674f9423465069396a48394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/git/trees/9fc6e87597f6ea806674f9423465069396a48394"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/git/commits/27c686b981b7c5a24314c5e06d407dbd372b035b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9fc6e87597f6ea806674f9423465069396a48394\nparent 4c0e9c48f98c1c5cc6734e38fb7b41a37db4d03e\nauthor copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1776284496 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776284496 +0000\n\nfix: resolve perf gate file paths to absolute and add E2E timeouts\n\nThe Performance Regression Gates job was failing because run_backend_perf_gate.py\nreceived relative paths (e.g. backend/perf-gate-results.xml) but pytest runs from\nBACKEND_DIR, so the JUnit XML was written to backend/backend/perf-gate-results.xml\nwhile the script tried to read from backend/perf-gate-results.xml.\n\nFix: resolve paths to absolute before use.\n\nAlso adds timeout-minutes: 20 to all E2E test jobs to prevent indefinite hangs.\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/sessions/907fba91-c67c-4af6-be1a-e13d198d92ef\n\nCo-authored-by: Yogevso <156666724+Yogevso@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\