":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/commits/5e910f7b4f610e066473694e6eaac97f5460029a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-15T19:54:28Z","email":"198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"copilot-swe-agent[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-15T19:54:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: harden CI E2E tests and performance gates for reliability\n\n- Set PW_SKIP_WEBSERVER=1 and BASE_URL to use CI-managed servers\n  (fixes port mismatch where Playwright started own servers on 8010/3100\n  with rate limiting enabled, ignoring CI''s servers on 8000/3000)\n- Add search index rebuild step after seeding in all E2E jobs\n  (ensures search functionality works in E2E tests)\n- Set SEARCH_BACKEND_MODE=sqlite_fts5 explicitly in all E2E jobs\n- Replace fragile sleep+curl health checks with retry loops\n  (30 attempts × 2s = 60s max wait vs fixed 5-10s sleep)\n- Add http://127.0.0.1:3000 to CORS_ORIGINS for robustness\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/sessions/34aea6e8-b9ce-438e-a112-64600a15f0e8\n\nCo-authored-by: Yogevso <156666724+Yogevso@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"028064c48b56f9010c48753e4dc711dd5b35b3b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/git/trees/028064c48b56f9010c48753e4dc711dd5b35b3b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Yogevso/finale_project/git/commits/5e910f7b4f610e066473694e6eaac97f5460029a","verification":{"payload":"tree 028064c48b56f9010c48753e4dc711dd5b35b3b7\nparent bff9660ae6bc81fd3f123ef7406fba4e82adb038\nauthor copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com> 1776282868 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776282868 +0000\n\nfix: harden CI E2E tests and performance gates for reliability\n\n- Set PW_SKIP_WEBSERVER=1 and BASE_URL to use CI-managed servers\n  (fixes port mismatch where Playwright started own servers on 8010/3100\n  with rate limiting enabled, ignoring CI''s servers on 8000/3000)\n- Add search index rebuild step after seeding in all E2E jobs\n  (ensures search functionality works in E2E tests)\n- Set SEARCH_BACKEND_MODE=sqlite_fts5 explicitly in all E2E jobs\n- Replace fragile sleep+curl health checks with retry loops\n  (30 attempts × 2s = 60s max wait vs fixed 5-10s sleep)\n- Add http://127.0.0.1:3000 to CORS_ORIGINS for robustness\n\nAgent-Logs-Url: https://github.com/Yogevso/finale_project/sessions/34aea6e8-b9ce-438e-a112-64600a15f0e8\n\nCo-authored-by: Yogevso <156666724+Yogevso@users.noreply.github.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3+z0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYDUQAIQbqKPTrr7tkFPSp9MqJtSr\n0w1BaYn1J3c7t2Wf+l1Vg6oxEA08BIot9QbO5v6EASrvNeTcmCeReKFNF1T4DGPW\nahekFCNm74gQblP9plvCRC6FlYJUFOr1hUUA6ilzbgxtz34v5Zmes78Bvi6pzwQA\nohZGInQnM7Ba1rwtZQhMYXXmUvLaiq6s0pNR5fFZETWIcc+9IAltSOX9rSqALNe0\ngHW3Ht5dJiqLBNHc/qxK48h6T3AHQhHOK9S+BAczk6ExdpjV45IstfHkhFLi8UtQ\nMBBSY7nR4VOBcpD+YhbNx4rVgiVC7hRL9mytQoEvzXEvQkdzsAXptk4Axg6zg2in\nO6h5cb08p59Q/bhmVA7mMk5fDfPH7R2gefUpTC4jiH3d1TxhtqRIkikQhGyqTs89\n27UZoF3gIhk/uUP4pD2cfI2TTfhRMB0JFQFV2I0xrdRlSfZj//hc2Y+7l/kQowbE\nzfGu/waafEAhO4fW4EXuG+eizevqYaPB3aLZYkqudb9VSraDJ38pylGfuL3ltUVb\n48eXE7id3O3EP5sm9Qji8Wr6mooKbwpiT0G6YZa94eOMVHSvkgabvmFBhs3i2UI0\n/Eutrm6QEgi2+55QHBNojpdIecal7rfgAt1R8CgLV2YgthQxDTsdmUDDbWnaVKts\nCQuoTss/TngUuIR7paS+\n=7jLy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-15T19:54:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_